    dcterms:source "https://www.prisma-statement.org/"@en ;
    skos:definition "PRISMA 2020 is the Preferred Reporting Items for Systematic Reviews and Meta-Analyses checklist and flow diagram for transparent reporting of systematic reviews."@en .

